29. /**
30.  * Utility that reads {@link SourceFeature SourceFeatures} from the geometries contained in an ESRI shapefile.
31.  * <p>
32.  * Shapefile processing handled by geotools {@link ShapefileDataStore}.
33.  *
34.  * @see <a href=
